WEBVTT

00:06:29.422 --> 00:06:32.660
and we will tell you:
do you pass, or do you fail."

00:06:33.366 --> 00:06:36.993
So because we were seeing
so many issues with the Theranos device

00:06:37.017 --> 00:06:40.302
that was actively being used
to test on patients,

00:06:40.326 --> 00:06:42.714
what we had done
is we had taken the sample

00:06:42.738 --> 00:06:45.555
and we had run it
through an FDA-approved machine

00:06:45.579 --> 00:06:48.087
and we had run it
through the Theranos device.

00:06:48.659 --> 00:06:50.096
And guess what happened?

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:53.928
We got two very, very different results.

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:56.816
So what do you think
they did in this scenario?

00:06:57.405 --> 00:07:00.825
You would anticipate
that you would tell the regulators,